<title>UK: C. Salvesen names Aggreko finance chief.</title>
<headline>C. Salvesen names Aggreko finance chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified distribution group Christian Salvesen Plc said on Thursday it had named Stuart Paterson finance director of its Aggreko equipment hire business, which will be demerged later this year.</p>
<p>Paterson, currently European manufacturing controller at Motorola Inc, would join Aggreko on July 28, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
